    {
      "topic": "staff",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 17,
      "title": {
        "en": "Kind receptionists alongside sharp complaints"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Many pet owners praise front desk team members like Dayma and Esmeralda for their warm welcomes, patient attitudes, and calming presence during stressful visits. However, several dissatisfied clients describe painful experiences where staff appeared indifferent, careless, or unwilling to provide immediate attention during end-of-life visits and critical health emergencies."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "communication",
      "sentiment": "mixed",
      "mentions": 8,
      "title": {
        "en": "Helpful explanations but missed callbacks"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Several reviewers appreciate clear medical explanations from the veterinarians and attentive check-in discussions with receptionists. In contrast, multiple unhappy clients report poor phone communication, including unreturned messages when trying to reach doctors, abrupt phone interactions, and disputes over required appointments to obtain prescription cat food."
      }
    },
    {
      "topic": "animals",
      "sentiment": "positive",
      "mentions": 6,
      "title": {
        "en": "Compassionate treatment for family pets"
      },
      "text": {
        "en": "Pet owners frequently highlight kind and patient handling during routine exams, rescue dog visits, and urgent lobby incidents like escaped cats. Many clients feel their pets are treated with genuine affection and gentle hands by the doctors and technicians. One reviewer felt that their senior dog received insensitive end-of-life care, but most owners report loving attention."
      }
    }
  ],
